description:
After slaying a dragon, Ikkarus returns to his village expecting glory, only to receive an unexpected “reward”: a run-down tavern, along with a debt of 50,000 gold coins.

What would enrage anyone else becomes a personal challenge. Determined to prove he is a true hero, Ikkarus decides to rebuild the place, manage the business, and show the man who gave him this “gift” that he made the right choice.

Along the way, he meets three men who can help him on this new journey, and maybe even steal his heart.

Follow Ikkarus in this yaoi slice-of-life about mixing drinks, dealing with peculiar bartenders, and hunting adorable monsters.

Over 5 hours of gameplay;

3 romance options (an orc, a demon, and a human);

6 different endings (one good and one bad for each partner);

13 illustrated CGs;

Difficulty selection, including an easy mode for visual novel–focused players;

Side quests.
